# A rising ramp delays the emission and makes the field more symmetric; a falling one does the opposite.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Leakage ramped from 0.05 to 0.5 per um
grating angle=10 length=25
apodise linear from=0.05 to=0.5
expect radiated 0.99896670 1e-06
expect overlap 0.84683783 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.42298140 2e-05
expect position 6.46020431 0.005
